 f objects from the VT Queer Archives\, and the chance to add your own memo
 ries and stories to the archives. Plus\, pick up your free copy of the new
  comic! Proud Little State is a project of UVM’s Center for Research on 
 Vermont\; the UVM Gender\, Sexuality\, & Women’s Studies program\; Vermo
 nt Folklife\; and the Vermont Queer Archives. Issue #2 was created with gr
 ant support from Vermont Humanities.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
